      "prov:value": "Per Criterion 3 of `folio-assistant-502c` and [`deployment-topologies.md` §2](../proposals/deployment-topologies.md#2-the-experiment-is-a-deployment-and-its-subject-is-not-the-folio), even a run with a real model **compares two orchestration harnesses on one diagram pair and one task bank; it must not be cited as a model-vs-model comparison.**",
